/-!
# GST CLASSICAL HODGE — PROJECTIVE WORD ORBIT

The rational projective-correspondence span is closed under linear
combinations, but the GST arsenal is intrinsically noncommutative: projectors,
Lefschetz moves and recoordination are assembled by composition as well as by
addition and scaling.

Instead of pretending that a composite filtered native pushforward is itself
the pushforward of one scheme endomorphism, this module builds the honest
free finite operator-word closure generated by actual projective self-maps.
Its primitives are genuine scheme endomorphisms; its constructors are exactly
the operator operations already used by the limitless cosmology:

* identity;
* addition;
* rational scaling;
* noncommutative composition.

Every primitive has kernel stability from genuine cycle-class functoriality,
and the existing kernel-stable operator algebra propagates that law through
all finite words.  Hence every projective word automatically acquires a
canonical ambient cohomological realization with an exact cycle-class square.

Combining this word algebra with the finite relevant-spine moment crown removes
another unnecessary restriction: the live-source target operator no longer
has to belong to the mere linear span of primitive pushforwards.  It may be an
arbitrarily deep finite noncommutative word in actual geometric transports.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 90000000
set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

noncomputable section

